  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I step into the overgrown pasture. Frost coats the grass, and a faint
    cowbell jingles somewhere nearby. A soft humming drifts on the breeze.\r\nFootprints
    in neat rows catch my eye, too small and deliberate to be modern. A blue scarf
    flutters from a branch, and a half-buried milk bottle glints in the snow.\r\n\u201CThis\u2026
    could it be her?\u201D I whisper.\r\nA frail figure emerges. \u201CThis used
    to be my land,\u201D she says.\r\n\u201CTanti Didina?\u201D My voice trembles.\r\nShe
    looks down, silent. Memories flood me\u2014running through these fields as a
    child, the smell of warm milk, her laughter, calling us by name.\r\n\u201CYou
    gave us milk\u2026 you shared it with everyone. I remember it all,\u201D I murmur.\r\nHer
    eyes lift, soft and recognizing. \u201CDon\u2019t forget my story.\u201D\r\nI
    gather the scarf, bell, and bottle\u2014small pieces of a past that still lingers
    here.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72f92ac8e1f3ebe4d98cb43cb31a781d, type: 2}
