--- !u!114 &1470676067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1470676065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The village square is alive. Lights hang between houses, smoke curls from
    chimneys, and the smell of food drifts through the cold air. Children run between
    tables, laughing as they hang decorations and paint eggs. Villagers bustle around,
    setting the festival table, making fires, and preparing for the celebration.\r\nBut
    a hush falls over the crowd as one villager steps forward.\r\n \u201CMaria\u2026
    we have to tell you something. Something unexpected has happened. Tanti Geta
    has sadly passed away\u2026 may God rest her beautiful soul.\u201D\r\nA wave
    of surprise hits you. Your stomach drops slightly, your vision softens at the
    edges, and your lips tremble. \u201CNo\u2026 how is this possible? She looked
    fine yesterday. Was it all for nothing?\u201D\r\nAnother villager shakes their
    head gently. \u201CNo matter what, you\u2019ve done so much for the celebration.
    You can\u2019t give up now. Look at what you\u2019ve made possible!\u201D\r\nYou
    glance around, taking in the lively scene. And then, in the distance, more people
    appear\u2014families, children, and neighbors\u2014drawn to the festival, slowly
    filling the square and bringing warmth and life back to the village.\r\nThen
    a tall, cheerful man steps forward, watching the scene with a wide smile. \u201CWhat
    is going on here? Ha\u2026 my mother didn\u2019t lie in her will! The village\u2026
    it\u2019s alive again, just as she hoped.\u201D\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 72f92ac8e1f3ebe4d98cb43cb31a781d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1098693605787584827, guid: 72f92ac8e1f3ebe4d98cb43cb31a781d, type: 2}
