  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The bus comes to a slow, rattling stop. I step onto the frozen ground,
    gripping a crumpled piece of paper\u2014my name, Maria V., printed clearly at
    the top. It\u2019s the inheritance for my family home, the place I haven\u2019t
    seen since life took its course and I was still so very young.\r\nMy heart skips
    a beat. I don\u2019t know what I\u2019ll find\u2014how much time has left its
    mark, or if the house will even feel like home anymore. The wind bites at my
    cheeks as I glance toward the distant building, its silhouette shadowed among
    bare trees, waiting silently.\n\n\n\n\nLoading...\r\n"
