      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: cc0b3ff4467379548b7df5f7e83dd6a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentences.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: "Maria, I am so so grateful. Ah, you\u2019ve done a fine job! Look at
        that garden\u2026 so much brighter now. Just perfect for when the Spring
        fae will melt all the snow away. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: cc0b3ff4467379548b7df5f7e83dd6a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentences.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: "You know, I used to be a church painter. That was my life, making icons
        and painting sacred stories\u2026 but nowadays, there aren\u2019t churches
        being built like before, and my work isn\u2019t needed anymore. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: cc0b3ff4467379548b7df5f7e83dd6a2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentences.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: Here, take some of the fish I caught, a few vegetables from the basket,
        and some bread to go with it. Everyone has an icoana here, so I can share
        this one with someone new.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: cc0b3ff4467379548b7df5f7e83dd6a2, type: 3}
